# Portfolio workflow

## Deploy default

After completing code changes, **always commit and push to `main`** so Vercel deploys — unless the user explicitly says not to (e.g. "בלי deploy", "רק מקומי", "אל תעלה").

When deploying:
- Run `git add` for relevant files only
- Write a short, accurate commit message
- Push to origin
- Confirm commit hash and that push succeeded

Question-only or review-only tasks: do **not** deploy.

## Task prompt template

User prefers focused requests. When unclear, infer minimally — don't ask many questions.

```markdown
## משימה
[משפט אחד]

## איפה
[עמוד / קובץ / @path / Figma node]

## שינוי
- [רשימה מדויקת]

## אל תיגע ב
[optional]

## deploy
ברירת מחדל: כן (commit + push) — רק "לא" אם המשתמש ביקש במפורש
```

## Efficiency

- Minimize diff scope
- Match existing code conventions
- Batch independent reads; avoid broad "audit entire site" unless asked
